  formula will be `y = <large_num> / (1 + <large_num>)`

  >>> x = tf.constant([0.0, 1.0, 50.0, 100.0])
  >>> tf.math.sigmoid(x)
  <tf.Tensor: shape=(4,), dtype=float32,
  numpy=array([0.5, 0.7310586, 1.0, 1.0], dtype=float32)>

